Side [drop-down list]
Select the side at which Plant Simulation places the Interface.
Remarks
You can select: The Top, the Right, the Bottom, the Left of the Frame, or depending on the Angle.
Angle-dependent takes the angle between the objects into account when determining the starting point
or the end point of the Connector.
