Position in % [Interface]
Type in the position at which Plant Simulation shows an arriving or leaving Connector at the icon of the
Frame.
Remarks
You can type in a value between 0 and 100 %.
Position 0 is either the top or the left-hand side at the icon of the Frame, position 100 the bottom or the
right-hand side at the icon.
Plant Simulation uses the value you specify, when you activate File > Preferences > General > Connect
Objects Automatically.
Connecting objects automatically only works, if the exit of FrameA and the entrance of FrameB are not
more than three pixels apart.
SimTalk
