External Connections
Opens a table displaying the paths of the external connections in the Frame in which the Interface object
is located.
Remarks
The column Connector designates the Connector at the exit of the Frame.
The column Object designates the object name of the succeeding object.
Instead, you can also click the Interface with the right mouse button in the Frame and select Open
External Connections List on the context menu.
See also
Refresh [on View menu]
Context menu > Open External Connections List
Context menu > Show External Connected Objects
